10. Repository-mutating producers run in a per-Story worktree. Before
    provisioning or trusting it, resolve the integration base: an explicit
    `integration_base_branch`, else the one branch a remote-neutral discovery
    uniquely names (never an assumed `origin`), else — only with no remote at
